      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village’s modest size is reflected in its status as a village within Guernsey County, Ohio, with local governance centered in a town hall.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pleasant_City%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "other"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A notable industry in Pleasant City is the Ohio Valley Glass Company, a local manufacturer that has been a staple of the community for decades.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pleasant_City%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pleasant City sits in the Appalachian foothills near the junction of Interstates 77 and 70, a crossroads that once boosted its early growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.citydirectory.us/village-pleasant-city.html",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
